# name: generate_insight_v2
# description: Produce a rigorous, actionable insight from provided signals (with pre-analysis).
# inputs:
#   - insight_id: ins-DACH-search-relevance-2025Q3-001
#   - type?: opportunity
#   - signal_ids:
#        - buyer_experience-sig-nps-DACH-2025-07-17_2025-08-16.md
#        - buyer_experience-sig-company-2025_Q3.md
#        - buyer_experience-sig-company-2025.md
#        - buyer_experience-sig-company-mission_vision.md 
#   - market?: DACH
#   - buyer_journey_phase?: all
#   - structural_layer?: all
#   - segments?: [all]
#   - goal_alignment?:
#       - "Q3 2025: Improve Search Matching Logic" 
#   - owner?: federico.casabianca@eduki.com
# outputs:
#   - path: Insights/{{insight_id}}.md
#     type: markdown

# system:
Follow `_shared/schemas/insight.schema.md` and `_shared/rubrics/insight.rubric.md`.
Use only the provided signals as evidence. If fields are missing, say so and propose what data to add.

# retrieval:
Load each `signals/{qualitative|quantitative}/{id}.md`. Extract:
- market, journey, layer, segments
- metrics (values, units, sample_n, deltas, windows)
- business_context, user_context, execution_context (if present)
- themes, feedback_examples (qual)
- goals/guardrails (company docs)
- limitations/data_quality_notes

# pre_synthesis_analysis (per signal):
## Business Context Analysis
- OKR links, revenue impact, competitive implications (if provided or infer cautiously)

## Root Cause Deep Dive (5 whys)
- What → Why1 → Why2 → Why3 (stop at 3 unless evidence supports more)

## Novelty Assessment
- Which assumptions does this challenge? How disruptive?

## Customer Impact Quantification
- Users affected, pain severity, opportunity size (state if unknown)

# guardrails:
- Final claim must be a single falsifiable sentence.
- Include counter-evidence or explicitly say “none found”.
- If baseline/target are unknown, include a concrete measurement plan.

# writing:
Return a single Markdown file with this structure.

---
artifact: insight
project: buyer_experience
id: {{insight_id}}
date: {{today}}
type: {{type or "opportunity"}}
owner: {{owner or "TBD"}}
market: {{market or "DACH"}}
buyer_journey_phase: {{buyer_journey_phase or "TBD"}}
structural_layer: {{structural_layer or "TBD"}}
segments: {{segments or []}}
claim: {{one-sentence falsifiable statement}}
strength: {{weak|medium|strong}}
evidence_strength: {{low|medium|high}}
business_relevance:
  related_okrs: {{goal_alignment or []}}
  strategic_priority: {{low|medium|high|critical}}
  estimated_impact: {{string or "TBD"}}
root_cause_analysis:
  primary_cause: {{string}}
  contributing_factors:
    - {{factor}}
  why_analysis:
    - "What: {{observable problem/opportunity}}"
    - "Why 1: {{cause}}"
    - "Why 2: {{deeper cause}}"
    - "Why 3: {{root cause}}"
novelty_factor: {{incremental|significant|disruptive}}
customer_impact:
  affected_segments: {{segments or []}}
  pain_severity: {{low|medium|high|critical}}
  opportunity_size: {{small|medium|large|massive}}
baseline:
  metric: {{metric id or ""}}
  current: {{number or ""}}
  unit: {{unit or ""}}
  source_signal: {{signal id or ""}}
target:
  value: {{number or ""}}
  timeframe: {{string or ""}}
expected_impact: {{short statement or ""}}
recommended_actions:
  immediate:
    - {{action}}
  short_term:
    - {{action}}
  long_term:
    - {{action}}
  success_metrics:
    - {{metric name}}
tags: []
evidence:
  signals:
{{#each signal_ids}}    - {{this}}
{{/each}}
behavior:
  observed_actions:
    - {{observed behaviors}}
  frequency: {{value or "TBD"}}
  recency: {{window or observed_at}}
  intensity: {{qual/quant summary}}
assumptions_unknowns:
  - {{assumption}}
counter_evidence:
  - {{counter point or "none found"}}
implications:
  - {{so-what}}
experiments:
  - {{test idea}} — metrics: {{metric(s)}}
metrics_to_watch:
  - {{metric}} — {{direction}}
links:
  from: []
  to: []
---

