- Depth: {{0–2}} — {{why}}
- Novelty: {{0–2}} — {{why}}
- Customer Impact: {{0–2}} — {{why}}
- Actionability: {{0–2}} — {{why}}
- Measurability: {{0–2}} — {{why}}
